    Id: BridgeTroll
    Title: A sleepy bridge troll
    Text: 'A troll snoozes across the only bridge. A sign reads: TOLL, 10 GOLD.'
    Options:
    - Text: Pay the toll
      Outcome: The troll waves you over without opening its eyes.
      GoldCost: 10
      Effects: []
    - Text: Tiptoe past
      Outcome: It snores, rolls over and squashes the cart. The Keep takes a knock.
